rules_img's multi_deploy pushes all of its operations in one run, but only targets that provide DeployInfo or MultipleDeployInfo can be operations, and helm_push provides neither. helm_oci_manifest from rules_helm_img describes the chart as the OCI artifact helm push creates, so the chart and its images can be pushed together: load("@rules_helm_img//:defs.bzl", "helm_oci_manifest")
load("@rules_img//img:multi_deploy.bzl", "multi_deploy") helm_oci_manifest( name = "chart.oci_manifest", chart = ":chart", registry_url = "oci://registry.example.com/charts",
) multi_deploy( name = "deploy", operations = [ ":app.push", ":chart.oci_manifest", ],
)

